# Optional endpoint for majadu-alert@.service. Install on the VPS as
# /srv/qouver/apps/majadu/env/alert.env with mode 600.
#
# Without this file the alert unit still logs to the journal; it just does not
# send anything outside the machine. That is the honest default: a missing URL
# should not look like a delivered page. With it, the unit retries three times
# and appends an undelivered message to logs/alert-dead-letter.log.
MAJADU_ALERT_WEBHOOK=
